abCoolDude","id":123309403,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mNWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123309403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude","html_url":"https://github.com/GabCoolDude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T11:15:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T11:15:03Z","body":"Your [GPU](https://www.techpowerup.com/gpu-specs/radeon-520-oem.c4061) _technically_ supports DX12, but the feature level is reported as only supporting dx11.1, maybe try updating your drivers.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4097317263/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101429984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117650#issuecomment-4101429984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117650","id":4101429984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70dtrg","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T23:24:10Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T23:24:10Z","body":"> Most likely another person affected by DX12 being the default?\n\nYeah, it seems exactly that.\n\n----------------------\n\n> Forward+ didn't work on 4.6.1-stable, 4.6.2-rc1, 4.7-dev2 then I switched to Compatibility and it worked on all 3 versions. So the issue is on me or something? What do I do now?\n\nSomething changed in Godot code between 4.5 and 4.6 that triggers the crash, but needs someone that undestand about the rendering area to check what happened. As you said the project created in 4.5.1 also worked in the other versions is because in 4.5.x the default driver for Windows is Vulkan, but for projects created on 4.6 onwards D3D12 is used as default. To confirm that, check the project created in 4.5.1, open the Project Sethings and look at `Rendering -> Rendering Device -> driver.windows`, if this is setted as `vulkan`, change to `d3d12` and restart the project to see if trigger the crash (be sure to be using `Forward+` as renderer).\n\nIf confirmed the problem only happens with `D3D12` the workarounds options are:\n\n- Create the project using the `Compatibility` and change the driver to vulkan later, so you can switch to `Forward+`\n- Use the Compatibility renderer\n- Stay on 4.5.x until a new version with a fix become available","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101429984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101615014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117650#issuecomment-4101615014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117650","id":4101615014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70ea2m","user":{"login":"NguyenPhuSep19th2002","id":90917772,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTE3Nzcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90917772?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002","html_url":"https://github.com/NguyenPhuSep19th2002","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NguyenPhuSep19th2002/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T00:30:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T00:30:48Z","body":">  maybe try updating your drivers.\n\nI checked, it was already the latest update\n\n> change to `d3d12` and restart the project to see if trigger the crash\n\nYeah, the project is crashed. Thanks for support, appreciated","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101615014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4602399347","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117650#issuecomment-4602399347","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117650","id":4602399347,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABElMKcw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T12:32:20Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T12:32:20Z","body":"@NguyenPhuSep19th2002 To double check, can you try the following:\n- Run with `d3d12` explicitly: `Godot_v4.6.3-stable_win64.exe --rendering-driver d3d12 --rendering-method forward_plus`\n- Run with `vulkan` explicitly: `Godot_v4.6.3-stable_win64.exe --rendering-driver vulkan --rendering-method forward_plus`\n- Run with `opengl3` explicitly: `Godot_v4.6.3-stable_win64.exe --rendering-driver opengl3 --rendering-method compatibility`\n\nThese commands will run the project manager by default, unless you run them in a project folder. You can add `--editor --path path\\to\\project` to open a project with the editor.\n\nIf the hypothesis so far is correct, `d3d12` will crash but `vulkan` and `opengl3` should work.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4602399347/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4602460337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117650#issuecomment-4602460337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117650","id":4602460337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABElP4sQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":